==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[sebaceous]] [[gland]]}}

# {{context|anatomy|lang=en}} A gland of the skin which secretes an oily substance, [[sebum]], usually into a [[hair follicle]] near the surface of the skin.

====Synonyms====
* [[sebaceous follicle]]
* [[glandulae sebaceae]]

